  "sourceCautions": [
    "The 6,467,235-byte webpage workbook differs in reported size from the 5,860,657-byte NPRM docket attachment. No docket bytes were acquired, so the files cannot be equated or their content differences characterized.",
    "Final-model attachment 1 and output-calculator attachment 2 are selected by document order and identity, not API array position. Both returned HTTP 403; the final-workbook archive index returned no captures.",
    "Draft Table 2-16 lists mixer and pumper separately at 25 and 40. Final Table 2-17 retains separate rows but assigns both 42. Only vehicle 19C_Mix_Cl8_MP is traced here; no separate pumper vehicle is established.",
    "The draft HTML text's C18 typography is not the exact native Cl8 identifier. Native workbook cells and visually reviewed final Table 2-18 establish the scoped vehicle match.",
    "Both analyses describe a percentage of total energy, while the implementation descriptions multiply the PTO percentage by driving fuel use excluding PTO. Preserve that denominator distinction; no total-fuel-share conversion or scientific validation is claimed.",
    "The native N12 and N13 PTO identifiers are cached shared-formula children of N9. They are not literal inputs. The O12 and O13 percentage cells are literals. J25 is a formula with a matching cached value.",
    "Source inspection and consistency tests are not independent manual review, authentication of the original MEMA docket file, or evidence of a causal lobbying effect."
  ],
